cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "compile-time-data-contracts"
abstract: >-
  A Scala macro that decides declared structural conformance between a producer case class and
  a contract case class under a named compatibility policy, before the build completes, with a
  policy-aware runtime pin at the Spark sink. Ships with a 2668-cell comparison of four schema
  equality predicate owners and the harnesses that produced it.
